### Positive feedback
POST http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Asha", "email": "asha@example.com", "product": "Blender", "rating": 5, "comment": "Works really well" }

### Negative feedback -> alert file in ./alerts
POST http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Ravi", "email": "ravi@example.com", "product": "Kettle", "rating": 1, "comment": "Stopped working" }

### Rating 3 with a complaint keyword -> NEGATIVE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Meena", "email": "meena@example.com", "product": "Iron", "rating": 3, "comment": "I want a refund" }

### Invalid -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "", "email": "not-an-email", "product": "Fan", "rating": 9 }

### List all
GET http://localhost:8080/api/feedback

### Summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/feedback/summary

### One item (paste an id from a POST response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/feedback/REPLACE-WITH-ID
